\section{Field Equations of Validator Recursion Geometry}

We derive the full set of field equations from the unified action
\begin{equation}
S = \int d^4x\,\sqrt{-g}\left[
\frac{1}{2}g^{\mu\nu}(D_\mu\Psi)(D_\nu\Psi)
