\end{equation}
where $T^{\mu\nu}$ is the total stress-energy tensor of matter and gauge
fields.

Using the standard identity
\begin{equation}
\delta R_{\mathrm{geom}}
=
R_{\mu\nu}\delta g^{\mu\nu}
+ \nabla_\mu\nabla_\nu \delta g^{\mu\nu}
- g_{\mu\nu}\Box \delta g^{\mu\nu},
