we obtain the modified Einstein equation:
\begin{equation}
G_{\mu\nu}
=
8\pi G\, T_{\mu\nu}
+ \alpha \left[
R_{\mathrm{rec}} G_{\mu\nu}
+ (g_{\mu\nu}\Box - \nabla_\mu\nabla_\nu) R_{\mathrm{rec}}
