Thus:
\begin{equation}
\boxed{
(1 - \alpha R_{\mathrm{rec}}) G_{\mu\nu}
=
8\pi G\, T_{\mu\nu}
+ \alpha (g_{\mu\nu}\Box - \nabla_\mu\nabla_\nu) R_{\mathrm{rec}}.
